strator error. That left us-east on v2.3.0 and us-west and eu-west on v2.3.1. I retried the same rollback, and it completed across all regions.\n- **Current state:** All regions are on v2.3.0, healthy, with an error rate of 0.002 (down from 0.18).\n- **Incident:** The first incident request timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found INC-0001 already open with the full summary, so I did not create a duplicate.\n\nFollow-up: the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure is still unknown, and the orchestrator partial failure needs investigation. v2.3.1 should not be redeployed until it is fixed and has a healthy validation run.", "type": "text"}]}]}